  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;| &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse-legacy-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1040/660/traverse.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oeSBh9T.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">🇺🇸 🇫🇷 🇪🇸 🇲🇽 🇷🇺</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概览</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp; 本模组旨在为 Dynamic Trees 与 Traverse 添加兼容性。本项目基于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/odorousrex\" rel=\"nofollow\">odorousrex</a> 的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-traverse-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始项目</a> 进行分叉开发，支持 Dynamic Trees 的新版本，并补充了原版插件中未包含的生物群系（如迷你丛林）的世界生成功能。</p>\n<p>1.12.2 至 1.19.2 版本使用 Traverse Reforged，而 1.20.1 版本使用原版 Traverse 模组，并需安装 Sinytra Connector。</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>功能特性</strong></h2>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/367/967/fir_log.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;树木</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>迷你丛林（仅限 1.12 和 1.16 版本）</li>\n<li>冷杉</li>\n<li>棕色秋橡树</li>\n<li>红色秋橡树</li>\n<li>橙色秋橡树</li>\n<li>黄色秋桦树</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/360/707/cactus.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> DT+（1.16 及以上）</strong></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictreesplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees +</a> 为可选依赖项。安装后，Traverse 生物群系中的所有仙人掌将被替换为 DT+ 中的仙人掌物种。</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SRb8VX6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 依赖项</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse-legacy-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse Reforged（1.12.2 至 1.19.2 版本）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse（1.20.1 版本）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector（1.20.1 版本）</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>授权与整合包</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本人特此授权在任何整合包或服务器中使用本模组。在我已明确告知您可自由使用的前提下，请勿再次询问授权，这很令人困扰。所有源代码均可在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesTraverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上查看，本项目采用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesTraverse/blob/1.12.2/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 许可证</a>。</p>\n<p>如需了解当前支持的语言翻译、更多信息及贡献者名单，请参见页面顶部的国旗标识，或点击<a href=\"https://github.com/harleyoc1/dynamictreestraverse#translations\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>查看。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
